  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS-   Norwegian Rakhine Fund- Sittwe General Hospital</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is the first stage of implementation of one of the series of recommendations of the Advisory Commission on Rakhine State.  Norway through the Norwegian Rakhine Fund project implemented by UNOPS has contributed to the Master Plan for the Sittwe General Hospital.   This project  through UNOPS  is mainly to support the design of Mother and Child Care Hospital and building of staff accomodation for the Sitwe General Hospital.</narrative>
  </description>
